      "created": 1793512429195,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Normal HTTPS/HTTP calls me client ko harr chiz server me bhejni hoti hai\njisse server pe load bad jta hai, meanwhile WebRTC me signaling server se info\nleke client direcly dusre client ko file/data bhej skta hai bina server pe load diye hoe",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
